/Title (BGS Industrial Solution is a new venture founded by Mr Bharat Khanna \(Director\), Mr Gaurav Khanna \(Director\) and Mr Shubham Khanna \(Director\). It is a sister concern for Bharat DyeChem Pvt Ltd which is a market leader in Textile Industry for last 70 Years. BGS Industrial Solution was started with the idea to diversify and create a multi-dimensional business which will cater to Automotive, Electronics, Steel, Rubber, Glass, Furniture, Construction, Railway and sanitary industry. With the support of Stickova Adhesives and Pidilite Inc, we tend to provide the best quality products with a competitive price against our competitors)
